    "title": "Scott Frost hired as UCF Knights football coach, replacing Gus Malzahn",
    "text": "UCFUCF Knights football hires Scott Frost as new coach, replacing Gus Malzahn Chris BoyleDaytona Beach News-JournalDec. 7, 2024Updated Dec. 8, 2024, 12:01 a.m. ETORLANDO — The architect of UCF's greatest football season in program history is back.Scott Frost will return as the Knights' head coach, agreeing to a five-year contract that runs through the 2029 season, athletic director Terry Mohajir announced late Saturday evening in a statement. The Orlando Sentinel's Matt Murschel first reported the news.",
